{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "e928532b0c2d503c1d78e258c77910f217476e88c8382dbb32c23a86b99d17fd", "ja": "今日こそ、たしかめてみるのです！\n朋花ちゃんのおだんご、さわさわはいほー！", "zh": "今天公主一定要确认一下！\n小朋花的丸子头，让我摸摸Hi Ho！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "5d2075dde23fc4e0bbad74f3f4bbde9603682ffe8151288df731974ed2ade0b5", "ja": "まつりさん～？\n髪型が崩れてしまいますから、やめてくださいね～。", "zh": "茉莉～？\n我的发型会乱掉的，请不要乱摸喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "19e3a349e39240a6fdbd318da5d1923fea92586aa0ee49eadd35e7baf5777c7f", "ja": "ほ？　よけるのです？　もしかして……\n本当は、何か他のものを隠しているのです？", "zh": "哦？躲开了。难不成……\n里面真的藏了什么东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "635f9c3feec6819064a873bf757995b41cf047ebd203342870c497ece90db054", "ja": "さぁ、どうでしょう？\nうふふ……うふふふふ……♪", "zh": "这个嘛，谁知道呢？\n呵呵……呵呵呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "20573ac073256aa957c33cbf109d86b7d522fe0a71fabbec24f7546772fafee2", "ja": "ほ？　……ほ？", "zh": "哦？\n……哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "c035c4a04c009facd3e3913a6e40b5f301991d054023b7d5e5d8c5eb4cb27978", "ja": "えっ……、ええ～っ！？\nふ、ふたりとも、ケンカはよくないよぉ……？", "zh": "咦……咦咦～！？\n两、两位，吵架是不好的喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1006_p", "source_sha256": "55d35ddfd64d0b7e1c172f6400272506bae0c6cf1c5332df831a1a70b59eb23b", "ja": "おーい、何をやって……うわっ！？\nなんだなんだ、この威圧感は！", "zh": "喂──你们在做什……唔哇！？\n这股压迫感是怎么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "130581946b29ce82889c8dcc4dbb02b9a0773fabda46d57233c688958e34fb5f", "ja": "{$P$}、いいとこに来てくれたべさ。\nあのね、朋花さんとまつり姫さんが……。", "zh": "{$P$}，你来得正好哪。\n我跟你说，朋花姊跟茉莉公主她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "6b1d85100cfcc4dba94fbc935c7fb6d4e0f23f673fe07923e129ea9fa50398ff", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ジャマしないで\nほしいのです。これは姫と朋花ちゃんの勝負なのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，希望你别干涉公主我们。\n这是公主跟小朋花之间的胜负喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "c33a630b89cf78f8d9b25376553fa9a896d091bacf3d44690f0571175f9d5dee", "ja": "そうですよ、{$P$}さん～。\n聖なる戦いに、横槍はいけません～。", "zh": "就是说呀，{$P$}先生～\n神圣之战是不容许他人干涉的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1010_p", "source_sha256": "145c6bc6e1f00c72a3a445d5ec25039fcf88a557bc73495ff54542d13d222fdd", "ja": "一体、何でそんなことに……いや、とにかくダメだ。\nふたりとも、ひなたが心配してるぞ。", "zh": "究竟为什么会变成这样……不，总之就是不行。\n你们看，日向都在担心你们两个了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "6c6657246235f64a4621c458ac8e29866dece7172888975890c6279b8d2edbcb", "ja": "うう……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "1754df67a19f1c8e00a6ce3dfc8c1bf619750785642e49bfbe1258fed14b2e83", "ja": "あら……。", "zh": "哎呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "e43f38271dc073fd7c630355b723285bfe738ee4f219260d7a8c21fb37fa02be", "ja": "ひなたちゃんが心配するのでは、仕方がありません。\n一時休戦なのです。", "zh": "既然会让小日向担心，那就没办法了。\n暂时停战的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "fdb81fcc21b35bf036b1784989c16a812b755702eebd3ef3fc752925f45729ff", "ja": "ええ、そうですね。\nここはお互い、いったん引きましょうか～。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n现在就暂且各退一步吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aa68df8318e080281883fb29a9573aacfd351e7f302deb44133a28f7a794f33c", "ja": "できれば、そのままずっと引いてて欲しいけどな！\n……ところで、ひなたに話があるんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "可以的话，我希望你们就这样永远停战！\n……话说回来，我有事想跟日向说，方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "6ca299aa07132e8a92bd8d29f631cf8e0ab48621e0330522cbaf4a54228e207e", "ja": "話？　あたしにかい？", "zh": "有事？找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1017_p", "source_sha256": "28c337548af7bf45efe1114252a15eb125bba83530653e6f308bb48dcb68d942", "ja": "ああ。次の公演のセンター、\nひなたに任せようと思って。やってみないか？", "zh": "嗯，我想请日向来担任下次公演的Center。\n你要不要试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "a2e6bcbf77e4e3c7a2e8aa66ee57f29c279e5faf527caed660062cf836436767", "ja": "え……えええっ！？\nセンターって、あたしが？", "zh": "咦……咦咦咦！？\n你是说，由我担任Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "a53c47b4bf8d53cfdc220c0ee03a4137218aeaede5d72ab488945458ae05a3d2", "ja": "センターって、そんな大事なお役目……\nあ、あたしなんかに、できるんだろか……？", "zh": "像Center这么重要的工作……\n我、我这样的人有办法胜任吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_1020", "source_sha256": "0fbd4ee41a48ec2bfdb1cf21a016137568596a7c0215f3dcbb19ccfd07772862", "ja": "できる！", "zh": "可以的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ace0ff6ec5e68fb4faffdb692e2646b0efba395136432639c126e36536fd779d", "ja": "できるさ。みんなと一緒に頑張ってきた、\n今のひなたなら、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "可以的，日向都跟大家一起努力了这么久，\n现在的你一定没有问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2001_035hin", "source_sha256": "0dde35c867489f24be4a28c1fcce3b40ef5a000b26ab9010c90ea8e7dd5a9f2b", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nけど、あたし……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n可是，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2002_021mat", "source_sha256": "5c18515de033e9dbdd24b546702dc85b5b55e1283e0b071e5dfe6d1eff2f4af2", "ja": "大丈夫なのです、ひなたちゃん。\n姫たちがついているのです。", "zh": "不要紧的喔，小日向。\n有公主我们陪在你身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2003_031tom", "source_sha256": "a2f8ec3e7085f3332db2e528c58da5ba03992670748b2e49c5bb24bf3ce45a7d", "ja": "そうですよ、ひなたちゃん～。\nひなたちゃんは、ひとりではありません～。", "zh": "就是说啊，小日～\n小日并不孤单～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2004_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a3d727de837aa0d0f603782411e73795626488bfe51c6989a8718d01537b68f", "ja": "まつり姫さん……朋花さん……。", "zh": "茉莉公主……朋花姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2005_035hin", "source_sha256": "4069bb2eba8d3ab9cd98c6303e774d89772a81b449e5aef86c3ccab737754cea", "ja": "あ、あたし……やっぱし、まだ自信はないけども……\nでも、ふたりがそう言ってくれんなら……。", "zh": "虽、虽然……我还是没有自信……\n不过，既然你们都这么说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2006_035hin", "source_sha256": "871e68e33e52ae7f65537a5a8870d07a98ef92d932bc66592297e5b265088c8c", "ja": "{$P$}……\nあたし、やってみるべさ！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我要试试看哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2007_p", "source_sha256": "5095b08ee3dce9a34245efa79a4af6dc60f9a7b435c54741d895654eef21492c", "ja": "よし、その意気だ！\nもちろん俺も手伝うから、一緒に頑張ろうな。", "zh": "很好，就是这股干劲！\n我当然也会协助你，一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2008_035hin", "source_sha256": "0b6b21b616cd865ed224a4c4b612e319e00814847de74cd6c2a2faf566837c94", "ja": "うん！\n{$P$}、よろしく頼みます。", "zh": "嗯！\n{$P$}，请多关照了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2009_021mat", "source_sha256": "6cf851ccae4eeffa79314d75710df2a6d10f19c20d2423c8dab5f0d4f5be2954", "ja": "ひなたちゃんの公演はきっと、わんだほー！な\nステージになるのです。姫が保証するのですよ。", "zh": "小日向的公演一定会是非常美妙的表演唷！\n公主跟你保证喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2010_031tom", "source_sha256": "95c12b23de08c5079d71d345a0db6f66567fe766937fe520ab18deedf3f20700", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね。それに関しては、私も\nまつりさんと同意見ですよ～♪", "zh": "呵呵，就是说呀。\n关于这点，我跟茉莉的看法相同喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2011_035hin", "source_sha256": "b4d9b4299ee63d228402362417148f4cc5dda9cd880ac43767d4c5d5126f489c", "ja": "えへへ……ふたりとも、ありがとうねぇ。\nあたし、がんばるよぉ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你们～\n我会加油的哪～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_036_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_036_2012_p", "source_sha256": "6b220334d199c4b058e881fe44486ab5bb22d5bb09440fcc590fcded3c95fad6", "ja": "（ひなたは穏やかだけど、芯の強い子だ。\nひなたらしいセンター公演……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（日向虽然文静，其实是个坚韧的孩子。\n具有日向特色的Center公演……真是让人期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
